2. Dataset: IMGT/mAbOnco-KG (third-party data, separate terms)
================================================================================

The knowledge-graph dataset distributed under data/ (the IMGT/mAbOnco-KG
train/valid/test splits and derivatives thereof) is NOT the original work of
the authors of this repository. It is derived from:

    Sanou et al. (2026), "Therapeutic monoclonal antibodies repurposing in
    oncology via IMGT/mAb-KG embeddings", BMC Medical Informatics and
    Decision Making 26:89. doi:10.1186/s12911-026-03394-4

    Sanou et al. (2024), "IMGT/mAb-KG: The knowledge graph for therapeutic
    monoclonal antibodies", Frontiers in Immunology 15:1393839.
    doi:10.3389/fimmu.2024.1393839

The source dataset repository
(https://src.koda.cnrs.fr/imgt-igh/oncomabkgembeddings) is licensed under the
European Union Public Licence v1.2 (EUPL-1.2). The underlying data originates
from IMGT, the international ImMunoGeneTics information system
(https://www.imgt.org). This data is used here under the terms of its
original licence and the IMGT terms of use, which are independent of, and
take precedence over, the Apache-2.0 licence applied to this repository's
